1
00:00:00,008 --> 00:00:04,450
Dragon boat racing is an important event during the Dragon Boat Festival
赛龙舟是端午节期间的一项重要活动

2
00:00:04,567 --> 00:00:06,610
The boats are long and colorful
船很长而且色彩鲜艳

3
00:00:06,767 --> 00:00:08,490
Teams paddle fast to win
团队快速划桨以赢得胜利

4
00:00:08,528 --> 00:00:10,010
The drummer keeps the beat
鼓手保持节拍

5
00:00:10,087 --> 00:00:11,811
The crowd cheers loudly
人群大声欢呼

6
00:00:11,848 --> 00:00:13,606
We watch the race by the river
我们在河边观看比赛

7
00:00:13,608 --> 00:00:16,047
It is exciting to see who wins
看谁赢了真让人激动

8
00:00:16,047 --> 00:00:20,161
I Love dragon boat racing because it is fun and traditional
我喜欢赛龙舟因为它既有趣又传统

